  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_WorkUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: "This section's solid. One thing, though\u2014second paragraph, 'in summary'
      reads a little stiff. 'Anyway' would land better."
    holdSeconds: 7.565094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 219341979747aae4fa27fb1b046bc117, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_YoungMan_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Mm-hm.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ac3d7e9d07910c49a6cb655cc0b0ba3, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_WorkUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: Want me to bring in last week's chart?
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb7e4fe2410571642a5d59687fc1b5ca, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_YoungMan_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Yeah, thanks.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ee80e1c27bdd1f46a274917f4604cac, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_WorkUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: Before I go back to the document, do you still want help with that message
      to your mom?
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3410a4fb6ce36564db1fe3b26c6fd30d, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_YoungMan_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: "Yeah. Just\u2014tell her work ran late. Make it sound like I'm not blowing
      her off again."
    holdSeconds: 7.1877356
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7613785f59b2cb047be4cf5a1bc8b041, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_WorkUnit_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: "How about: 'Hey Mom, work ran late\u2014don't wait up for dinner. I'll
      swing by tomorrow and bring something good.'"
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3ce47639023693e4bab04d382ec6aacc, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_YoungMan_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: That's good. Send it.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e74dd7bd5323a948b45dceb55f61eb0, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_WorkUnit_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Work Unit
    text: 'Sent. She wrote back: ''Okay, honey. Don''t stay too late. See you tomorrow.'''
    holdSeconds: 6.0556602
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd6baced751affc4ba0355c6cbcca7f5, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_Group02_YoungMan_YoungMan_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Young Man
    text: Perfect. Thanks, man. One less thing.
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 214d0dbe84ee24a4ea4aa48d16765166, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
